WEBVTT

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:47.080
All our lives were saved thanks to you.

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:48.420
Thank you very much.

00:01:49.370 --> 00:01:50.670
Thank you very much.

00:01:58.980 --> 00:02:00.930
What's with the cosplay?

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:03.390
He's the hero of justice.

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:05.310
Nii-chan, are you OK?

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:07.730
Yeah, thanks.

00:02:07.730 --> 00:02:09.440
What's your name?

00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:11.450
Kanzaki Jin.

00:02:13.960 --> 00:02:16.650
Let's get something to eat some time.

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:17.530
Your girlfriend can come, too.

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:19.600
One of these days, sure.

00:02:20.450 --> 00:02:21.410
What's up with you?

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:23.660
He said I'm your girlfriend...

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:25.160
Huh?

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:26.330
So what?

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:28.210
What?

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:31.000
You're the real hero, Jin.

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:42.300
The chairman is waiting for you, Kouga-sama.

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:44.960
Jin.

00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:46.430
And your girlfriend, too!

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:52.800
Episode 8: A Normal Family

00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:02.070
I never thought you'd learn about things like this.

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:03.490
Please tell me everything.

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:06.700
Ojii-sama, you know about it too, don't you?

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:08.000
About these monsters...

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:11.550
And on top of that, you know what Jin is..

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:15.000
It'll be a long story...

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:18.010
I want to hear that long story.

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:25.510
My headaches just wouldn't stop,

00:03:25.860 --> 00:03:29.060
and I passed out before I knew it.

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:32.520
I can hardly remember anything about what happened last night.

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:35.400
So you didn't see anything?

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:40.030
I saw some kind of weird bugs.

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:42.950
Like giant roaches,

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:46.350
so I got scared and kept my eyes shut the whole time.

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:51.160
It might be a hallucination brought on by your headache.

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:53.670
You should take it easy for the rest of the day.

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:56.090
There's nothing wrong with your body,

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:58.420
and I'll prescribe some medicine for your headaches.

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:00.170
Yes, thanks...

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:04.550
Stay here until I fall asleep.

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:15.560
I went to stop the Isono brothers!

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:18.320
Who said I went to stir things up?

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:20.940
Then why didn't you stop them?

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:24.200
Because Red Zet's scary.

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:26.870
I don't want to die just yet.

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:29.950
Those guys brought it on themselves.

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:32.960
Isn't that so?

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:38.590
The rules of EVOL say to not trouble humans.

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:41.300
They broke the rules.

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:43.130
Quite troublesome, right?

00:04:43.130 --> 00:04:46.470
Did you see Red Zet's abilities?

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:47.220
No.

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:49.970
Is that so?

00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:53.230
Can I get you to leave the matter of Zet in my hands?

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:56.190
I want to take good care of him.

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:58.980
I think of Zet as one of us.

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:01.980
One of us, huh?

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:10.280
How have you dealt with Konoha's friend?

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:13.120
Luckily, she had only minor injuries,

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:16.000
so I let her go after erasing all of her memories of last night!

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:17.880
A proper solution.

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:20.880
But Alphas is the problem.

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:24.590
Where did the funds to make Alphas come from?

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:27.890
From money entrusted to me by the
president for developing a strength suit.

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:31.890
I don't think I put it to poor use.

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:35.180
The company's expansion and Kouga-kun's dreams...

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:40.060
I think the Alphas project thoroughly satisfies both of these things.

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:42.270
I'm disappointed, Hayami-kun.

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:46.820
Hand over all the data from the Alphas project.

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:47.950
Got it?

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:49.370
Y-Yes.

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:50.490
Mr. President!

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:54.290
How should we deal with the homeless who witnessed the Players?

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:57.670
We don't need to pile up bodies unnecessarily.

00:05:57.670 --> 00:06:01.670
No one's going to believe what those lowlifes have to say.

00:06:01.970 --> 00:06:04.670
Too many things happened that were unplanned for...

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:07.220
It's not just Kouga-kun.

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:08.300
Konoha-kun as well.

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:12.050
We need to change our course of action.

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:18.100
Yes, but I wish you would have at least told me about Alphas.

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:20.810
Kabe-san, you're too close to the president.

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:24.530
You could say that the Amagi Corporation...

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:26.650
...is one of the main supporting forces of society now,

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:29.570
and sooner or later Kouga-kun's going to be the head of it.

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:35.330
When that time comes, I want him to stay an ally of justice...

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:37.870
...to protect Amagi!

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:42.460
Don't overdo it.

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:02.520
Okaa-san...

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:04.110
Konoha!

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:06.860
Where's Jin-kun?

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:15.330
You were called here by Konoha, too?

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:15.870
Yeah.

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:20.370
I heard from my grandfather...

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:24.210
About you and the Players... everything.

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:26.970
I see.

00:07:26.970 --> 00:07:29.470
I haven't sorted it all out for myself yet,

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:32.640
but I'm going to fight!

00:07:32.640 --> 00:07:34.850
It's my mission as an Amagi.

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:37.640
If this is a mission, it's mine as well.

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:39.640
Will you fight together with me?

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:40.850
Like when we were kids!

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:44.520
I don't recall ever joining up with you.

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:47.360
Please wait.

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:50.900
Why you were born, and your form...

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:53.410
I'm really moved by everything about you!

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:54.660
What?

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:55.490
Please look at this.

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:58.000
Idiot!

00:07:58.000 --> 00:07:59.310
Put it back!

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:00.960
Sorry.

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:03.920
But you've seen this, too, haven't you?

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:05.880
I was told that this form of yours was based on a design...

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:10.880
...from an animation company that my
grandfather had as part of Amagi Group.

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:15.260
A form like a devil that would be feared by Players...

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:20.270
Apparently Alphas was designed by the same person.

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:21.770
So we're brothers!

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:25.150
Our meeting has to be fate!

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:26.770
Cut it out!

00:08:27.160 --> 00:08:29.900
Fighting with the Players isn't a game.

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:32.820
Right, it's not.

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:36.070
With me as Alphas, and you as Zetman-

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:37.410
Hold on a sec.

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:38.530
What do you mean, "Zetman"?

00:08:38.920 --> 00:08:41.160
It's your name as a hero!

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:48.170
What's a "Player"?

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:50.550
I heard it loud and clear.

00:08:55.430 --> 00:08:58.220
He said that our family had created them.

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:00.600
What did he mean?

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:02.140
Why don't we talk about this later?

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:05.060
No, I want to talk about it now.

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:07.480
Jin-kun and Nii-chan saved me, right?

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:10.360
How did you fight with that monster?

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:13.030
Is there something that you guys know?

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:15.200
Konoha...

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:20.030
The truth is we don't really understand it ourselves.

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:22.750
We're still in the middle of looking into it.

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:28.250
I see... I understand.

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:34.840
Why did you stop me?

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:36.680
If you told her, then what?

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:38.890
This is a problem for the Amagis!

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:41.010
Shouldn't the family face it together?

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:43.270
There are some things you're better not knowing.

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:45.390
Konoha's doubting your story!

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:49.770
There may be more victims of the Players out there right now.

00:09:50.160 --> 00:09:54.150
When I think about that, I can't just sit back and do nothing.

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:57.530
What is it?

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:00.140
Got it.

00:10:00.140 --> 00:10:01.030
I'm on my way.

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:03.910
Tanaka called.

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:05.500
She's being discharged from the hospital.

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:06.790
Go see her.

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:07.710
Right.

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:17.380
Kaa-san?

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:19.680
What do you plan on doing next?

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:20.930
Isn't it obvious?

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:21.680
I'm going to fight.

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:25.810
I'll be fine.

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:28.100
Don't worry, Kaa-san.

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:30.900
Is this something you have to do?

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:33.070
It's the same as volunteer work.

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:35.730
It's saving others.

00:10:35.730 --> 00:10:40.320
I think it's my responsibility to take this on as an Amagi!

00:11:13.310 --> 00:11:14.820
Break up with that girl.

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:20.990
I believe I told you not to get close to any humans.

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:23.490
I just can't leave her be.

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:28.910
I want to investigate what happened to your body.

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:30.460
We're going to the research lab.

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:40.220
Let's go home together.

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:43.340
Sorry, there's somewhere I have to be.

00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:45.510
I can't come along?

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:46.390
You can't.

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:49.730
I don't want to be alone!

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:52.850
You have a proper home, don't you?

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:55.730
I feel even more alone there.

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:57.360
No way.

00:11:57.360 --> 00:11:59.190
You have a family, right?

00:11:59.190 --> 00:12:00.360
Being with my parents is even worse.

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:02.110
I seriously hate it.

00:12:02.540 --> 00:12:04.530
Don't say things like that.

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:08.620
I hate people who can't get along with their families.

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:19.920
I'll come get you later.

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:20.760
I'll be waiting, then.

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:30.770
It's nice to have people waiting for you.

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:33.600
You better come for me!

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:35.350
OK, I promise you.

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:40.360
When I get back, want to try being a family?

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:41.780
Huh?

00:12:42.100 --> 00:12:46.280
But for now I have to go to some place.

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:50.580
So if you go home for a bit while I'm gone,

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:52.500
I'll be able to go without worrying.

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:54.120
I understand.

00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:18.810
So she's Hanako?

00:13:19.560 --> 00:13:21.210
It's a nice name.

00:13:26.150 --> 00:13:27.570
I'm coming, too.

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:29.950
I want to know about everything for the sake of what's to come.

00:13:31.710 --> 00:13:33.080
Are you fine with that?

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:35.690
It's unavoidable.

00:13:35.690 --> 00:13:36.210
Let's go!

00:13:56.030 --> 00:13:57.990
Was Jin born here?

00:13:57.990 --> 00:13:58.600
No.

00:13:59.230 --> 00:14:03.110
The place where Jin was born has already been destroyed.

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:06.150
I told you at an earlier time that the...

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:08.820
...Amagi Corporation was engaging in research on...

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:13.680
...the creation of "Net", an earthling completely different from humans.

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:19.120
Zet was born out of pure coincidence during that research.

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:23.250
In an error in Net, the N's changed into Z's.

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:27.260
Surprisingly, this is the completed form.

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:29.050
Completed?

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:32.760
Then we should call this creature Zet.

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:34.600
Zet...

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:45.530
We thought of using Zet as an anti-Player weapon.

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:49.780
Mr. Chairman!

00:14:50.170 --> 00:14:51.280
Kanzaki...

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:53.580
It's just as I predicted.

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:55.740
When we sent Jin's data out to Kanzaki,

00:14:55.740 --> 00:14:57.410
there was a response!

00:14:57.770 --> 00:14:59.500
For the first time in two years...

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:00.420
Two years?

00:15:00.420 --> 00:15:03.040
The first time Jin came here,

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:05.420
his Zet factors were quite small in number,

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:07.670
and he was living almost the same life as a human.

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:11.300
Kanzaki, who wanted to make Jin a human,

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:17.180
has been silent for these past two years
since he was satisfied with the outcome.

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:21.060
Kanzaki...

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:27.190
The surge in Zet factors is calming down.

00:15:27.730 --> 00:15:31.820
This is the result of taking in that fragment of the Ring of Exposure.

00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:36.410
But he's not complete even with that?

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:38.040
Unfortunately not.

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:40.080
What do you think of Zet yourself?

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:42.580
Why ask that?

00:15:43.030 --> 00:15:44.960
It's hard to say this,

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:48.300
but I heard about you from my grandfather and thought this:

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:50.590
You're just being abused by those around you.

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:51.840
It's not like that.

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:55.930
I chose to live as Zet.

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:59.350
I don't think I can fight unless I achieve the complete form.

00:15:59.770 --> 00:16:01.850
Is Jin there?

00:16:05.860 --> 00:16:06.900
That's right.

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:07.770
He's here.

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:09.730
Hold it!

00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:10.570
What is this?

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:12.820
It's Kanzaki.

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:18.080
I want you to ask him:

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:21.370
What should you do to achieve the complete form?

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:24.120
What do you mean, ask him?

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:30.130
You momentarily obtained the final form with the Ring of Exposure.

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:34.220
I get the feeling that this man, Haitani,

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:39.390
has far more knowledge about you than we do.

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:42.390
I don't care about any of that!

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:44.900
Is Jii-chan alive?!

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:48.900
Have you made it to the Ring of Exposure?

00:16:49.270 --> 00:16:50.530
Jii-chan!

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:53.490
But that's still not enough.

00:16:53.490 --> 00:16:54.910
Where are you, Jii-chan?!

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:58.240
If he's alive, let me see him!

00:16:58.240 --> 00:16:59.160
Let go of him, Jin!

00:17:19.480 --> 00:17:20.640
Jin!

00:17:31.270 --> 00:17:34.190
The chairman's taking a gamble, too.

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:38.700
Do you think Jin will be able to stay calm after seeing Kanzaki that way?

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:40.950
We should prepare ourselves for the unexpected.

00:17:41.880 --> 00:17:42.790
No!

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:48.420
I think the chairman wants Jin to meet
Kanzaki specifically because of how Jin is now.

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:53.460
Now that Jin has something he wants to protect...

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:06.980
Kanzaki's in there.

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:09.730
Hurry and let me see him!

00:18:29.580 --> 00:18:31.750
W-What is that?

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:34.750
It's Kanzaki.

00:18:35.260 --> 00:18:36.550
Don't mess with me!

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:38.120
What did you do to Jii-chan?

00:18:38.120 --> 00:18:38.130
Jii-chan!
What did you do to Jii-chan?

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:39.090
Jii-chan!

00:18:39.550 --> 00:18:41.010
You can't!

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:43.100
There's a wall of air here.

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:49.980
It's to keep Kanzaki adequately preserved and to quarantine him from any bacteria.

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:10.210
Jii-sama, what is this...?

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:12.290
Only his brain remains alive.

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:16.590
He should've been started up again as a mere databank,

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:18.300
but he has his own will.

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:22.890
So go ahead and ask him with your own words!

00:19:22.890 --> 00:19:26.510
What do you need to become complete?

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:29.810
Why show me something so awful?

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:35.020
A Player is the one who killed Kanzaki.

00:19:35.020 --> 00:19:38.110
You were born to hunt the Players,

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:41.360
and you also agreed to become Zet.

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:46.240
This isn't the human path that Kanzaki wanted you to have,

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:51.710
but now you have something you love and strongly want to protect.

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:57.090
You need power to protect things.

00:19:57.090 --> 00:19:59.810
Convey that to Kanzaki!

00:19:59.810 --> 00:20:03.510
Tell him you want to be Zet to protect what's important to you!

00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:07.260
Red stone?

00:20:09.390 --> 00:20:11.020
Got it.

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:13.230
Jin!

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:14.230
Stop it!

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:15.230
You idiot!

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:30.620
Let Jii-chan die in peace.

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:33.710
I'll go meet Haitani.

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:37.500
You're a demon.

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:43.840
These are Dr. Kanzaki's last words to you.

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:48.140
Yeah... I'm eating.

00:20:49.510 --> 00:20:52.520
These aren't his only words!

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:56.480
He asked if you had the red stone.

00:20:56.480 --> 00:20:58.190
The red stone...

00:20:58.190 --> 00:20:59.860
Does that ring any bells?

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:01.990
Stone...

00:21:07.240 --> 00:21:09.910
Kaa-san, where are you now?

00:21:10.410 --> 00:21:12.370
I just got home.

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:14.910
Konoha said she really wanted to return home.

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:19.290
Then, please ask Konoha if she still has the pendant.

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:21.250
Pendant?

00:21:21.250 --> 00:21:23.300
The pendant with a red stone in it.

00:21:23.760 --> 00:21:28.050
Tomomi-san returned it to her, so she should have it.

00:21:28.640 --> 00:21:30.890
She's already asleep.

00:21:30.890 --> 00:21:32.470
Can this wait until tomorrow?

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:34.310
Tomorrow's too late.

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:41.980
Want to try being a family?

00:22:10.140 --> 00:22:16.100
Your birthday comes,

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:22.940
and I pick a present for you.

00:22:22.940 --> 00:22:29.200
I stop my feet on fifth street.

00:22:29.200 --> 00:22:35.870
This love can't be changed.

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:45.420
Darling, stop the clock, stop your head,

00:22:45.420 --> 00:22:51.260
stop your heart, your eyes and ears, and everything.

00:22:51.260 --> 00:22:58.100
Darling, all the words I received from you.

00:22:58.100 --> 00:23:09.530
Hugging you as if embracing a rose with no thorns.

00:23:09.530 --> 00:23:17.160
Darling, the miracle of the two of us meeting in this world.

00:23:17.160 --> 00:23:28.590
With only a trace of that, me loving you.

00:23:36.050 --> 00:23:36.870
W-What?

00:23:36.870 --> 00:23:37.760
Jin-kun?

00:23:37.760 --> 00:23:39.280
Why are you here?

00:23:39.280 --> 00:23:41.900
Nice guess, brother.

00:23:43.140 --> 00:23:45.460
Things are getting fun!
